@startuml
actor User
participant "Registration Page (UI)" as UI
participant "SupabaseAuthService" as Auth
participant "Supabase API" as Supabase

User -> UI: Enter Name, Email, Password
UI -> UI: Validate Form Data
UI -> Auth: registerUser(email, password, fullName)
Auth -> Supabase: auth.signUp({email, password, data: {full_name}})
Supabase --> Auth: User Data & Session
Auth --> UI: Success Response
UI -> User: Redirect to Login with Success Message
@enduml
